stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Forgotten : static ctor, or Register() at SubsystemRegistration calls Forget()
    Forgotten --> Listening : Begin() from the first field, _sessions 1, Listen(Keyboard.current), SetIMEEnabled(true)
    Listening --> Listening : Begin() from another field, _sessions + 1, composition cleared
    Listening --> Listening : End() while _sessions > 1, _sessions - 1, switch left on
    Listening --> Listening : onIMECompositionChange, _composition = string
    Listening --> Listening : onDeviceChange and Keyboard.current differs, Unlisten(false), Listen(current)
    Listening --> Forgotten : End() from the last field, Unlisten(disableIme true), composition cleared
    note right of Listening
        TryGetComposition returns the cached _composition.
        ReportsPlatformState is false: empty means no event, not platform released.
    end note
